1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:03,003
[theme music playing]

2
00:01:03,022 --> 00:01:05,648
- [Young-man pants]
- [Gye-young] Oh, come on, hurry up.

3
00:01:05,649 --> 00:01:07,276
[Soo-jeong] Oh, it's coming.

4
00:01:08,152 --> 00:01:09,736
- [chuckles]
- [Gye-young] Man...

5
00:01:09,737 --> 00:01:13,323
- Can't that thing take me home?
- [Kyung-sik] This is Opera. Fish, respond.

6
00:01:13,324 --> 00:01:15,450
- They do that?
- [Gye-young] Should I ask?

7
00:01:15,451 --> 00:01:18,412
- This is Opera. Fish, respond.
- [Soo-jeong] Can't hurt to ask.

8
00:01:20,623 --> 00:01:22,791
Are helicopters supposed to
shake like that?

9
00:01:22,792 --> 00:01:25,543
- [Kyung-sik] Fish respond.
- I've never seen one this close,

10
00:01:25,544 --> 00:01:27,921
but it does seem like
it's shaking quite a bit.

11
00:01:27,922 --> 00:01:29,756
[Kyung-sik] Opera. Fish respond.

12
00:01:29,757 --> 00:01:32,801
Maybe it's just turbulence
from the wind or something.

13
00:01:32,802 --> 00:01:35,345
[Kyung-sik] This is Opera, Opera.
Fish, respond.

14
00:01:35,346 --> 00:01:37,430
[radio static whooshing]

15
00:01:37,431 --> 00:01:40,392
[Kyung-sik] This is Opera, Opera.
Fish, respond.

16
00:01:41,352 --> 00:01:44,563
- [Tae-hwa] Hwang Kyung-sik!
- [Kyung-sik] Private Hwang Kyung-sik!

17
00:01:45,314 --> 00:01:47,316
- You reach them yet?
- They won't respond.

18
00:01:47,942 --> 00:01:50,235
[Tae-hwa]
They seem like bad pilots. Be careful.

19
00:01:50,236 --> 00:01:51,194
[Kyung-sik] Yes, sir.

20
00:01:51,195 --> 00:01:53,696
- [In-ho] Hey!
- [Gye-young] No, stay here.

21
00:01:53,697 --> 00:01:54,698
Wait, wait.

22
00:01:55,282 --> 00:01:56,866
- Sir!
- [Soo-jeong] Wait, hey!

23
00:01:56,867 --> 00:01:58,035
Hey, Ra In-ho!

24
00:01:58,744 --> 00:02:00,078
What is that brat doing?

25
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:02,623
You can't be here.
Get your head out of your ass!

26
00:02:03,415 --> 00:02:05,334
- You little shit.
- [grunts]

27
00:02:07,211 --> 00:02:09,380
Sir, you can't let them land.
Look what I saw.

28
00:02:10,214 --> 00:02:11,632
[Tae-hwa sighs]

29
00:02:13,217 --> 00:02:14,218
Shit.

30
00:02:20,349 --> 00:02:21,183
[Gye-young] Huh?

31
00:02:24,603 --> 00:02:26,104
[all exclaim]

32
00:02:26,105 --> 00:02:28,106
- [radio beeps]
- [Kyung-sik] This is Opera.

33
00:02:28,107 --> 00:02:30,276
- Fish respond.
- [radio static whooshing]

34
00:02:31,485 --> 00:02:33,153
[Tae-hwa panting]

35
00:02:37,908 --> 00:02:40,285
- For God's sake. Walk normally.
- [Young-joo moaning]

36
00:02:40,286 --> 00:02:42,453
Hold on, hold on. Wait.

37
00:02:42,454 --> 00:02:44,582
Okay, come on. Let's go in there.

38
00:02:45,875 --> 00:02:47,458
Go inside. Quick, quick.

39
00:02:47,459 --> 00:02:49,752
- Quick, quick.
- [continues moaning]

40
00:02:49,753 --> 00:02:50,962
Oh, shit!

41
00:02:50,963 --> 00:02:53,339
- Shit! Stop following me, okay?
- Hey, open up!

42
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:55,383
Find your own place. [chuckles]

43
00:02:55,384 --> 00:02:56,968
[wags tongue mockingly]

44
00:02:56,969 --> 00:02:58,053
[Tripeater grunts]

45
00:02:59,889 --> 00:03:01,098
[softly] Oh, shit.

46
00:03:04,685 --> 00:03:06,061
[shudders nervously]

47
00:03:06,687 --> 00:03:08,021
[hesitates]

48
00:03:08,022 --> 00:03:10,398
- N... Nobody?
- [Young-joo] I'm not even drunk.

49
00:03:10,399 --> 00:03:12,817
- [Jin-wook] My head hurts.
- [Tripeater] I'm sober.

50
00:03:12,818 --> 00:03:15,695
- [Young-joo laughs] Exactly.
- [Tripeater] We're heavyweights.

51
00:03:15,696 --> 00:03:17,030
- Yeah.
- [Young-joo sighs]

52
00:03:17,031 --> 00:03:18,781
- We should...
- I'm tired.

53
00:03:18,782 --> 00:03:21,951
- [Young-joo] Let's have a drink!
- Yeah! Cheers, Boozer!

54
00:03:21,952 --> 00:03:24,413
- They are insane.
- [Tripeater] To not being zombies.

55
00:03:24,997 --> 00:03:26,873
[people screaming]

56
00:03:26,874 --> 00:03:29,918
- [Young-joo] What's going on?
- [Tae-shik] Fire in the hole!

57
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:31,544
[Tripeater] Wait, that's a zombie.

58
00:03:31,545 --> 00:03:32,879
- [Jin-wook exclaims]
- Whoa!

59
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,672
- Fire in the hole.
- [Tripeater] See that?

60
00:03:34,673 --> 00:03:36,299
- Oh, it's Alex.
- That was sick.

61
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:38,009
- He's there. It's Alex.
- Alex.

62
00:03:38,010 --> 00:03:39,762
Alex, look over here, over here.

63
00:03:40,971 --> 00:03:41,971
[Young-joo gasps]

64
00:03:41,972 --> 00:03:43,390
- [tires screech]
- Ah, shit!

65
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:46,100
[Alex shuddering]

66
00:03:46,101 --> 00:03:47,226
[both cheering]

67
00:03:47,227 --> 00:03:49,187
- Good game!
- That was crazy to watch.

68
00:03:49,188 --> 00:03:51,064
- That was so cool.
- Cheers to that!

69
00:03:51,065 --> 00:03:53,358
- [Tripeater] Encore, encore.
- Are you guys serious?

70
00:03:53,359 --> 00:03:56,445
All right. I think that
you've had enough. Here.

71
00:03:57,112 --> 00:03:58,113
Drink this.

72
00:03:59,949 --> 00:04:01,325
[sniffs] Nasty!

73
00:04:01,825 --> 00:04:03,785
- Jesus Christ.
- [Tae-shik] Hurry.

74
00:04:03,786 --> 00:04:06,454
- [Young-joo] Give my beer back.
- [Tae-shik] Open the door.

75
00:04:06,455 --> 00:04:08,498
- [Tripeater] Alex.
- I always do the dirty work.

76
00:04:08,499 --> 00:04:10,333
- [Young-joo] Let him in.
- Right away, sir.

77
00:04:10,334 --> 00:04:12,752
- [Young-joo] That was awesome.
- [Tripeater] He's dope.

78
00:04:12,753 --> 00:04:14,629
- Come on, come on.
- [Tae-shik panting]

79
00:04:14,630 --> 00:04:16,881
- [Tripeater] Bravo! Wow!
- [Young-joo] Alex!

80
00:04:16,882 --> 00:04:19,300
[Tripeater] Ah, I think I got too wasted.

81
00:04:19,301 --> 00:04:22,637
You're so cool. Encore. Do an encore. Oh!

82
00:04:22,638 --> 00:04:24,097
- A zombie.
- [Young-joo] Oh!

83
00:04:24,098 --> 00:04:25,808
[Tripeater] Go, go!

84
00:04:26,392 --> 00:04:28,226
Now they're all fighting each other.

85
00:04:28,227 --> 00:04:29,560
Yeah, go Twins!

86
00:04:29,561 --> 00:04:32,105
- [cheers]
- Hey, root for the Giants not the Twins.

87
00:04:32,106 --> 00:04:33,523
The Twins.

88
00:04:33,524 --> 00:04:36,234
- Let's go, Giants! Bang!
- Twins, let's go.

89
00:04:36,235 --> 00:04:37,652
[Tae-shik singing] <i>♪ Fi-ga-ro ♪</i>

90
00:04:37,653 --> 00:04:39,029
[Tripeater] Go Giants!

91
00:04:39,947 --> 00:04:41,948
[helicopter blades whirring]

92
00:04:41,949 --> 00:04:44,117
[Tae-hwa panting]

93
00:04:44,118 --> 00:04:45,410
Ready your stations.

94
00:04:45,411 --> 00:04:47,912
Prepare small arms and anti-aircraft fire.

95
00:04:47,913 --> 00:04:49,999
All gunners to your stations, now!

96
00:04:59,008 --> 00:04:59,924
[Jae-yoon gasps]

97
00:04:59,925 --> 00:05:00,843
[Young-man gasps]

98
00:05:01,677 --> 00:05:02,970
[Jae-yoon] What?

99
00:05:03,804 --> 00:05:04,637
Stations, now!

100
00:05:04,638 --> 00:05:06,264
[thrilling music playing]

101
00:05:06,265 --> 00:05:07,391
This way!

102
00:05:07,725 --> 00:05:08,933
[zombies snarling]

103
00:05:08,934 --> 00:05:11,477
Gunner, be ready to neutralize
once it's in range.

104
00:05:11,478 --> 00:05:13,229
Ready to neutralize when in range!

105
00:05:13,230 --> 00:05:14,898
- [whirring]
- [Tae-hwa panting]

106
00:05:20,529 --> 00:05:21,863
They're still too far away!

107
00:05:21,864 --> 00:05:23,157
Ready your weapons.

108
00:05:23,866 --> 00:05:25,826
Aim and fire! Shoot it in the tail.

109
00:05:29,955 --> 00:05:32,290
- Ah, shit.
- Get it right if you wanna go home.

110
00:05:32,291 --> 00:05:34,293
Do you boys want to die today?

111
00:05:37,379 --> 00:05:40,048
Shit. Neutralize that target!

112
00:05:40,049 --> 00:05:43,176
- [Young-man] Neutralizing target!
- Neutralizing target!

113
00:05:43,177 --> 00:05:44,928
[In-ho] Neutralizing target!

114
00:05:52,019 --> 00:05:53,186
[Tae-hwa] Aim for the tail.

115
00:05:53,187 --> 00:05:55,104
Tail. Yes, sir.

116
00:05:55,105 --> 00:05:57,024
Aim for the tail!

117
00:06:01,653 --> 00:06:03,989
- Where's the target?
- It's almost in range.

118
00:06:04,698 --> 00:06:06,867
[Young-man breathing shakily]

119
00:06:08,368 --> 00:06:10,411
- Neutralize the target!
- Beam discharge!

120
00:06:10,412 --> 00:06:11,496
One, two...

121
00:06:11,497 --> 00:06:13,248
- Firing rounds! [grunts]
- [shots firing]

122
00:06:16,126 --> 00:06:17,211
Bring it down!

123
00:06:32,476 --> 00:06:34,478
[helicopter blades whirring]

124
00:06:47,282 --> 00:06:48,575
[sighs in relief]

125
00:06:50,285 --> 00:06:52,286
[Young-joo groans]

126
00:06:52,287 --> 00:06:53,747
Feel like I'm gonna die.

127
00:06:58,585 --> 00:06:59,503
Whoa!

128
00:07:00,129 --> 00:07:01,130
Look up there.

129
00:07:04,258 --> 00:07:06,259
- [Young-joo groans]
- We need to keep moving.

130
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:07,344
Come on, go.

131
00:07:10,347 --> 00:07:11,306
They're gone.

132
00:07:12,015 --> 00:07:13,142
- Come on.
- Right.

133
00:07:14,393 --> 00:07:16,060
- Keep Young-joo close.
- Come here.

134
00:07:16,061 --> 00:07:18,437
- [sighs] Careful.
- [Young-joo] I feel like death.

135
00:07:18,438 --> 00:07:21,816
- [Tae-shik] Keep your eyes open.
- [Jin-wook] You're okay. Hang in there.

136
00:07:21,817 --> 00:07:23,609
- [Tripeater] It's clear.
- [Tae-shik] Okay.

137
00:07:23,610 --> 00:07:24,570
[Tripeater] Let's go.

138
00:07:25,154 --> 00:07:28,323
Why the hell does the price of
a helicopter matter right now?

139
00:07:28,907 --> 00:07:30,783
[Commander on phone]
<i>How dare you shout at me?</i>

140
00:07:30,784 --> 00:07:33,245
<i>What's your problem?
Are you out of your mind?</i>

141
00:07:34,454 --> 00:07:35,581
Sir. I'm sorry.

142
00:07:37,124 --> 00:07:40,502
At this point,
since no more supplies will be sent,

143
00:07:41,086 --> 00:07:44,965
it could serve us to move to
the base camp in Suseo, at least for now.

144
00:07:46,175 --> 00:07:48,509
We'll run out of food
and water if we stay.

145
00:07:48,510 --> 00:07:49,803
We only have a few days.

146
00:07:50,512 --> 00:07:53,848
So if there's any way that we could join
the base camp setup in Suseo--

147
00:07:53,849 --> 00:07:57,810
<i>Stay there and stop talking nonsense.
I need you to lead. Can I count on you?</i>

148
00:07:57,811 --> 00:07:58,728
Yeah.

149
00:07:58,729 --> 00:08:01,398
<i>I'll check on the situation
and get back to you. Understand?</i>

150
00:08:02,441 --> 00:08:03,692
Yeah. Copy that.

151
00:08:04,943 --> 00:08:06,653
Salute. [sighs]

152
00:08:07,154 --> 00:08:07,988
[grunts angrily]

153
00:08:08,655 --> 00:08:09,615
Piece 'a shit!

154
00:08:10,407 --> 00:08:13,117
You want us to stay in this hellhole
and get ourselves killed?

155
00:08:13,118 --> 00:08:15,370
Motherfucker, I swear to God.

156
00:08:16,663 --> 00:08:17,998
All of you, focus.

157
00:08:19,291 --> 00:08:21,293
I've spoken to the commander.

158
00:08:23,670 --> 00:08:25,129
We're leaving this building today.

159
00:08:25,130 --> 00:08:27,216
[all exclaim in surprise]

160
00:08:29,218 --> 00:08:31,344
Is that order... because of the resupply?

161
00:08:31,345 --> 00:08:33,013
The resupply... [sighs]

162
00:08:34,097 --> 00:08:34,972
There isn't one.

163
00:08:34,973 --> 00:08:36,058
We can hold out, sir.

164
00:08:36,850 --> 00:08:39,602
We can make it a few weeks without food.

165
00:08:39,603 --> 00:08:41,437
- Ah!
- Young-man's right.

166
00:08:41,438 --> 00:08:42,897
We have the hotel water supply.

167
00:08:42,898 --> 00:08:45,609
The hotel's water tank
has more than enough water.

168
00:08:46,318 --> 00:08:48,986
However, the electricity
will go out shortly,

169
00:08:48,987 --> 00:08:52,366
and the pump supplying the water
from the tank won't work without it,

170
00:08:52,950 --> 00:08:56,786
No, but, sir. Why don't we just go
when the electricity cuts out?

171
00:08:56,787 --> 00:08:59,039
- Right, sir?
- [Jae-yoon clearing throat]

172
00:09:00,666 --> 00:09:03,542
You're gonna pick up a gun
while barely surviving on water?

173
00:09:03,543 --> 00:09:04,920
Ah, shit.

174
00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:08,590
It would behoove us to get moving now,
while we still have our strength.

175
00:09:09,508 --> 00:09:13,262
At this point,
the only option we have left,

176
00:09:14,179 --> 00:09:16,306
- is to fight our way out of here.
- [In-ho] Hmm.

177
00:09:16,890 --> 00:09:18,308
[Tae-hwa sighs]

178
00:09:19,268 --> 00:09:20,185
What is it?

179
00:09:23,897 --> 00:09:24,982
I want...

180
00:09:26,358 --> 00:09:27,442
I want a weapon, too.

181
00:09:28,318 --> 00:09:29,361
[Tae-hwa sighs]

182
00:09:30,570 --> 00:09:31,821
All right, listen here.

183
00:09:31,822 --> 00:09:34,573
I know everything that's happened here
is far from normal.

184
00:09:34,574 --> 00:09:36,200
Just don't push it.

185
00:09:36,201 --> 00:09:38,328
You already saw
what I can do with a gun. I--

186
00:09:39,162 --> 00:09:41,372
I was a shooting athlete
all through high school.

187
00:09:41,373 --> 00:09:43,416
I made it to
the National Reserve team, sir.

188
00:09:43,417 --> 00:09:45,335
I am more confident as a rifleman...

189
00:09:46,295 --> 00:09:47,421
than any of your men.

190
00:09:48,088 --> 00:09:50,132
If you want me to take a test...

191
00:09:50,966 --> 00:09:52,092
then I will, but...

192
00:09:52,592 --> 00:09:53,927
[breathing shakily]

193
00:09:54,845 --> 00:09:56,471
I need to defend myself, sir.

194
00:09:59,099 --> 00:10:00,683
- [Tae-shik] Wow.
- [Tripeater] Wow.

195
00:10:00,684 --> 00:10:02,601
- [Jin-wook] Holy shit!
- [Tripeater] Shit.

196
00:10:02,602 --> 00:10:05,731
- [Jin-wook] What the fuck happened?
- [Tae-shik] What a mess!

197
00:10:06,773 --> 00:10:08,608
[Jin-wook] Is this Gangnam station?

198
00:10:11,445 --> 00:10:13,196
This isn't how I thought I'd look.

199
00:10:14,323 --> 00:10:15,782
This place got destroyed.

200
00:10:19,161 --> 00:10:21,620
[Jin-wook] Well, fuck me.
What a warm welcome.

201
00:10:21,621 --> 00:10:23,707
[zombies snarling]

202
00:10:24,791 --> 00:10:26,709
Well, at least the ambulance arrived.

203
00:10:26,710 --> 00:10:28,837
You said there's soldiers in there?

204
00:10:31,798 --> 00:10:33,716
[Young-joo sobbing]

205
00:10:33,717 --> 00:10:35,718
Jae-yoon's in there. [crying]

206
00:10:35,719 --> 00:10:37,220
Wait, wait, wait, wait. Hey!

207
00:10:38,221 --> 00:10:41,390
You really wanna do that?
You don't see zombies in there.

208
00:10:41,391 --> 00:10:43,142
Those things will rip you apart.

209
00:10:43,143 --> 00:10:45,228
[snarling continues]

210
00:10:45,771 --> 00:10:46,896
I agree with Jin-wook.

211
00:10:46,897 --> 00:10:49,023
If we go in there, we're all dead.

212
00:10:49,024 --> 00:10:52,151
Let's wait till Jae-yoon calls.
We'll find shelter somewhere.

213
00:10:52,152 --> 00:10:54,528
- Okay?
- I'm sure he'll call soon.

214
00:10:54,529 --> 00:10:56,239
Let's just go to the parking lot.

215
00:10:57,449 --> 00:10:59,575
Yeah. You should try
not to worry about it.

216
00:10:59,576 --> 00:11:00,702
Let's get outta here.

217
00:11:01,661 --> 00:11:02,662
[Jin-wook sighs]

218
00:11:04,414 --> 00:11:06,583
- [Young-joo sobs]
- Let's go. You can't go in there.

219
00:11:07,667 --> 00:11:11,171
[Tripeater] Yeah. So hurry up, Boozer.
Come with us. Come on.

220
00:11:12,672 --> 00:11:14,673
[Tae-shik] They really took it over, huh?

221
00:11:14,674 --> 00:11:15,674
[Young-joo] Jae-yoon.

222
00:11:15,675 --> 00:11:17,426
[Tae-shik] It's like a zombie expo.

223
00:11:17,427 --> 00:11:20,679
Oh, great. Looks like
they made their way down here.

224
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:24,518
- [Tripeater] Did they throw a rager here?
- [Jin-wook] It's swarming with 'em.

225
00:11:25,018 --> 00:11:28,437
[Tae-shik] Is there anything in the car?
God, there's blood all over.

226
00:11:28,438 --> 00:11:31,733
- [Tripeater] Maybe it runs?
- [Tae-shik] Don't go on your own.

227
00:11:33,110 --> 00:11:35,112
[frightening music playing]

228
00:11:39,908 --> 00:11:40,992
Hold on. Hold on.

229
00:11:41,993 --> 00:11:46,539
Wait. The plate's 4574.
We'll look in teams of two, all right?

230
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:49,375
- Are you sure that it's in this area?
- That's why we're here.

231
00:11:49,376 --> 00:11:51,253
Navy blue Hummer. You got that?

232
00:11:53,296 --> 00:11:54,422
Wait a second.

233
00:11:54,423 --> 00:11:56,757
You really don't remember
where you parked your car?

234
00:11:56,758 --> 00:11:58,676
[Tae-shik] No, the valet parks for me...

235
00:11:58,677 --> 00:12:02,222
Hey, um... Sorry that I got so mad.

236
00:12:03,432 --> 00:12:04,683
It's your fault, honestly.

237
00:12:05,475 --> 00:12:08,894
If I let you run in there with that,
you'd already be dead right now.

238
00:12:08,895 --> 00:12:11,772
- Does that make sense?
- [Tripeater] What's that? Guys!

239
00:12:11,773 --> 00:12:12,940
- Run!
- Young-joo, run!

240
00:12:12,941 --> 00:12:14,108
- Come on.
- Run!

241
00:12:14,109 --> 00:12:16,027
- [zombies snarling]
- [both screaming]

242
00:12:20,407 --> 00:12:21,699
[snarls]

243
00:12:21,700 --> 00:12:23,493
[Young-joo shouting]

244
00:12:31,001 --> 00:12:32,002
Get away! No!

245
00:12:34,754 --> 00:12:36,756
[shouting]

246
00:12:37,299 --> 00:12:38,550
[Tae-shik] Fire in the hole!

247
00:12:39,885 --> 00:12:42,220
Fire in the hole!

248
00:12:43,263 --> 00:12:44,473
Fire in the hole!

249
00:12:48,101 --> 00:12:49,393
Fire in the hole!

250
00:12:49,394 --> 00:12:50,686
[Jin-wook] Get out!

251
00:12:50,687 --> 00:12:52,730
- Fire in the hole!
- Young-joo!

252
00:12:52,731 --> 00:12:54,024
[Tae-shik] Get outta there!

253
00:12:55,901 --> 00:12:56,985
[Tae-shik] ...in the hole!

254
00:12:57,986 --> 00:12:59,279
Fire in the hole!

255
00:13:01,323 --> 00:13:03,325
[yelling]

256
00:13:13,293 --> 00:13:15,295
[screaming]

257
00:13:16,338 --> 00:13:17,588
[squelching]

258
00:13:17,589 --> 00:13:20,424
- Alex, no!
- Are you trying to get yourself killed?

259
00:13:20,425 --> 00:13:22,676
What are you doing? No, Seo Jin-wook!

260
00:13:22,677 --> 00:13:24,136
- [yelling]
- Get in!

261
00:13:24,137 --> 00:13:26,931
- Fuck! Listen to me. Get in there.
- No!

262
00:13:26,932 --> 00:13:28,682
[Young-joo crying]

263
00:13:28,683 --> 00:13:30,101
[Tripeater crying]

264
00:13:31,811 --> 00:13:33,187
- [Young-joo] Alex.
- Fuck off!

265
00:13:33,188 --> 00:13:35,649
- [glass breaking]
- [Tripeater] Alex. Alex.

266
00:13:37,734 --> 00:13:39,401
[Young-joo crying]

267
00:13:39,402 --> 00:13:41,947
[Tripeater crying] Alex.

268
00:13:42,572 --> 00:13:44,115
Hey, no. I'm coming.

269
00:13:44,908 --> 00:13:46,660
[wailing]

270
00:13:47,285 --> 00:13:48,495
Alex!

271
00:13:49,955 --> 00:13:51,414
[crying hysterically]

272
00:13:52,874 --> 00:13:55,502
No! No!

273
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:58,505
[Tripeater crying]

274
00:14:13,144 --> 00:14:15,814
Listen, I know you're all scared.

275
00:14:17,315 --> 00:14:19,316
But we still need to win, regardless.

276
00:14:19,317 --> 00:14:20,694
Why, Hwang Kyung-sik?

277
00:14:21,486 --> 00:14:25,155
Private Hwang Kyung-sik!
Sir, it's because we're soldiers of Korea.

278
00:14:25,156 --> 00:14:28,660
[chuckles] Not quite.
You'd give the president that answer.

279
00:14:29,244 --> 00:14:30,078
Oh.

280
00:14:30,954 --> 00:14:31,870
Sir, I'm sorry.

281
00:14:31,871 --> 00:14:33,665
Do you know what winning truly is?

282
00:14:35,875 --> 00:14:38,920
Its surviving.
Survivors are the real winners.

283
00:14:41,131 --> 00:14:43,842
Do you know the quote by Yi Sun-shin?

284
00:14:44,259 --> 00:14:45,093
Anyone here?

285
00:14:52,183 --> 00:14:56,186
"Those who are willing to die will not.
Those aiming only to live will die."

286
00:14:56,187 --> 00:14:57,272
Correct.

287
00:15:00,692 --> 00:15:02,652
We're gonna do this with all we've got,

288
00:15:03,278 --> 00:15:04,446
and make it back home.

289
00:15:04,904 --> 00:15:06,363
[all] All that we've got!

290
00:15:06,364 --> 00:15:09,116
[Tae-hwa] Okay.
Now, all of you, get ready.

291
00:15:09,117 --> 00:15:10,451
[sniffles, cries]

292
00:15:10,452 --> 00:15:13,412
[Tae-hwa] We'll move to
the hotel VIP lounge through the stairs,

293
00:15:13,413 --> 00:15:15,582
and take the elevator the rest of the way.

294
00:15:16,291 --> 00:15:18,168
Got it? Let's go.

295
00:15:21,338 --> 00:15:24,673
[panting] Kim Young-man,
Kwak Gye-young, open it.

296
00:15:24,674 --> 00:15:25,884
- Yes sir, right away.
- Right away!

297
00:15:29,346 --> 00:15:31,347
Don't shoot until I say so,
am I understood?

298
00:15:31,348 --> 00:15:32,431
[all] Holding fire.

299
00:15:32,432 --> 00:15:35,644
- Now switch to short burst.
- [all] Switch to short burst.

300
00:15:36,269 --> 00:15:38,396
I'll count to three. One...

301
00:15:39,689 --> 00:15:40,690
Two...

302
00:15:42,359 --> 00:15:43,359
Three.

303
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:45,445
[thrilling music playing]

304
00:15:46,446 --> 00:15:48,656
- [In-ho whimpers]
- [Jae-yoon] God. What--

305
00:15:48,657 --> 00:15:51,283
[Soo-jeong] Oh, that's foul.
What the hell is that?

306
00:15:51,284 --> 00:15:54,037
- [all overlapping, exclaiming]
- [In-ho] What the hell?

307
00:15:54,496 --> 00:15:55,579
[zombie snarling]

308
00:15:55,580 --> 00:15:57,457
- [all yelling]
- [Tae-hwa] Open fire!

309
00:15:58,541 --> 00:16:00,918
[all yelling, overlapping]

310
00:16:00,919 --> 00:16:03,253
- [Soo-jeong] Oh, my gosh.
- [In-ho] Shoot it!

311
00:16:03,254 --> 00:16:06,799
[Jae-yoon] Oh, look out!
It's still moving. Holy, shit.

312
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:08,050
[In-ho] Shoot it!

313
00:16:08,051 --> 00:16:10,136
[pensive music playing]

314
00:16:23,149 --> 00:16:25,151
[Tripeater sobbing]

315
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,161
[sniffles]

316
00:16:36,579 --> 00:16:38,164
[sobbing]

317
00:16:52,554 --> 00:16:53,555
Hey!

318
00:16:54,556 --> 00:16:56,181
Looks like the car isn't here,

319
00:16:56,182 --> 00:16:58,392
so you should go
and search somewhere else!

320
00:16:58,393 --> 00:16:59,561
[Tripeater scoffs]

321
00:17:03,565 --> 00:17:04,732
What?

322
00:17:04,733 --> 00:17:06,985
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
- [Young-joo shouts]

323
00:17:08,611 --> 00:17:10,947
[scoffs] You coward.

324
00:17:12,949 --> 00:17:14,533
Are you insane, asshole?

325
00:17:14,534 --> 00:17:16,827
I'm gonna come out
and rip your face off.

326
00:17:16,828 --> 00:17:19,914
I'll throw you all the fucking way
across the parking garage.

327
00:17:21,124 --> 00:17:23,375
Oh, no... What should I do?

328
00:17:23,376 --> 00:17:25,253
You're lucky that I--

329
00:17:28,089 --> 00:17:29,631
Just go over there,

330
00:17:29,632 --> 00:17:32,593
go and get the stupid car
and drive it back, okay?

331
00:17:32,594 --> 00:17:33,927
But I never learned how.

332
00:17:33,928 --> 00:17:36,430
So you don't even have
your license, or anything?

333
00:17:36,431 --> 00:17:38,766
- I failed the test, so no!
- [Jin-wook scoffs]

334
00:17:38,767 --> 00:17:42,020
- I'll leave if you act like this.
- Hey, hold on. Just wait.

335
00:17:43,271 --> 00:17:44,397
[grunts frustratedly]

336
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:49,736
Wait, hey! We'll use our phones.
I think mine still has battery.

337
00:17:50,570 --> 00:17:51,612
What's your number?

338
00:17:51,613 --> 00:17:53,490
- [Tripeater] Hmm?
- [Young-joo] Your number.

339
00:17:54,949 --> 00:17:57,451
[Gye-young screaming]

340
00:17:57,452 --> 00:17:59,412
- [In-ho] Do you see any more?
- [Young-man] Go!

341
00:18:00,455 --> 00:18:02,749
[Tae-hwa] Be careful. Move.

342
00:18:03,208 --> 00:18:04,417
[Young-man] You sure they're dead?

343
00:18:05,710 --> 00:18:07,544
[In-ho whimpers]

344
00:18:07,545 --> 00:18:08,963
[Jae-yoon coughing]

345
00:18:09,506 --> 00:18:11,007
[Young-man] Hurry up, move, move!

346
00:18:11,216 --> 00:18:13,218
[all panting]

347
00:18:15,637 --> 00:18:16,638
[grunts]

348
00:18:21,351 --> 00:18:23,353
[all exclaim in disbelief]

349
00:18:33,863 --> 00:18:35,865
[gnarly music playing]

350
00:19:01,724 --> 00:19:02,725
Look at this shit.

351
00:19:03,309 --> 00:19:06,229
What's the price of a helicopter
when all this is going on?

352
00:19:10,108 --> 00:19:12,359
They want us to pay
for the one you shot down.

353
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:14,444
- [all gasping]
- Ah... The supply one?

354
00:19:14,445 --> 00:19:16,989
And you're all accomplices
so we'll split the bill later.

355
00:19:16,990 --> 00:19:18,448
[In-ho gasps]

356
00:19:18,449 --> 00:19:20,909
- Me too? But--
- How much is a helicopter?

357
00:19:20,910 --> 00:19:23,453
- I think expensive, sir.
- Shit. We're screwed.

358
00:19:23,454 --> 00:19:24,580
- Me too?
- Shit.

359
00:19:24,581 --> 00:19:26,207
- Um...
- I was kidding.

360
00:19:27,625 --> 00:19:28,751
[In-ho chuckles]

361
00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:31,921
- [Tae-hwa sighs]
- [In-ho laughs nervously]

362
00:19:34,173 --> 00:19:35,717
Before we all head downstairs,

363
00:19:36,551 --> 00:19:38,678
we'll go into pairs
and begin with the lounge.

364
00:19:39,929 --> 00:19:42,807
If everything's clear,
then we'll all maintain our guns,

365
00:19:43,308 --> 00:19:45,184
which will determine if we win today.

366
00:19:45,727 --> 00:19:48,896
Then we'll move ahead to
the next location and secure it.

367
00:19:48,897 --> 00:19:50,856
Do you all understand? Are you ready?

368
00:19:50,857 --> 00:19:52,149
[all] Yes, we are.

369
00:19:52,150 --> 00:19:55,027
Very good. Let's move
and begin the search.

370
00:19:55,028 --> 00:19:56,321
[all] Yes, sir.

371
00:19:56,821 --> 00:19:57,780
Come on, let's go.

372
00:20:05,121 --> 00:20:07,123
[zombies snarling]

373
00:20:11,127 --> 00:20:12,712
How am I gonna find this thing?

374
00:20:13,630 --> 00:20:18,384
This... Ah... Ah...

375
00:20:20,094 --> 00:20:21,596
- [car alarm beeps]
- Oh, my God.

376
00:20:25,975 --> 00:20:27,851
Hell, yeah. There we go. That's it.

377
00:20:27,852 --> 00:20:31,229
What's... 45... 74...

378
00:20:31,230 --> 00:20:32,398
Ha!

379
00:20:32,982 --> 00:20:34,067
Oh, man.

380
00:20:34,609 --> 00:20:36,361
Sorry, Zombies. Can you guys move?

381
00:20:36,903 --> 00:20:38,279
Excuse me, sorry.

382
00:20:40,490 --> 00:20:42,325
Go. There's nobody for you to eat.

383
00:20:44,994 --> 00:20:46,496
[zombies snarling]

384
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:52,960
God, I don't know how to work this thing.

385
00:20:52,961 --> 00:20:54,962
BOOZER

386
00:20:54,963 --> 00:20:56,422
[ringtone beeping]

387
00:20:57,632 --> 00:20:59,424
- Hello?
<i>- All right. You in the car?</i>

388
00:20:59,425 --> 00:21:01,761
- Yeah.
<i>- And you know how to start it, right?</i>

389
00:21:02,512 --> 00:21:04,972
I honestly don't.
I only took like one class.

390
00:21:04,973 --> 00:21:07,975
Ah, Christ.
The engine start button on the right.

391
00:21:07,976 --> 00:21:09,727
Engine start button?

392
00:21:12,313 --> 00:21:13,188
There isn't one.

393
00:21:13,189 --> 00:21:16,233
<i>Yeah, Hummers use keys.
There is a key hole next to the wheel.</i>

394
00:21:16,234 --> 00:21:17,276
Ah!

395
00:21:20,154 --> 00:21:21,947
- [car dings]
<i>- Did you start it?</i>

396
00:21:21,948 --> 00:21:24,992
No, not yet. It isn't working.

397
00:21:24,993 --> 00:21:26,368
<i>What's not working?</i>

398
00:21:26,369 --> 00:21:29,371
- What is wrong with this thing?
<i>- Brakes! Press the brake pedal.</i>

399
00:21:29,372 --> 00:21:32,207
<i>- You weren't stepping on the brakes pedal?</i>
- Guys, really?

400
00:21:32,208 --> 00:21:33,876
You never even told me I had to.

401
00:21:34,460 --> 00:21:36,712
So which one's the brake again?
The left or right one.

402
00:21:36,713 --> 00:21:38,548
<i>It's the one on the left! Come on.</i>

403
00:21:40,049 --> 00:21:42,634
I'm getting my license
when this is over. I swear.

404
00:21:42,635 --> 00:21:44,721
[engine turns over]

405
00:21:45,513 --> 00:21:46,848
All right. What's next?

406
00:21:47,390 --> 00:21:50,976
<i>Shift into D, and hit the gas pedal.
Steer with the wheel. You got that?</i>

407
00:21:50,977 --> 00:21:53,437
I can't hold the phone
and talk to you at the same time.

408
00:21:53,438 --> 00:21:54,814
Give me a minute.

409
00:21:55,815 --> 00:21:57,065
Ah, okay.

410
00:21:57,066 --> 00:21:59,901
- Should I put the seat belt on?
- [Jin-wook] <i>Whatever. Hurry.</i>

411
00:21:59,902 --> 00:22:01,446
- [Young-joo] <i>Put it on.</i>
- Okay.

412
00:22:02,822 --> 00:22:05,741
Why're you so high and mighty
just 'cause you can drive?

413
00:22:05,742 --> 00:22:08,870
It's not even that serious.
I'll be right there.

414
00:22:09,829 --> 00:22:12,205
- [engine revving]
- [yelling] Holy fuck! Shit, man.

415
00:22:12,206 --> 00:22:14,541
- Did I blow the engine?
<i>- Wait, wait.</i>

416
00:22:14,542 --> 00:22:17,044
<i>Hey, take your foot off
the brake, you dumbass.</i>

417
00:22:17,045 --> 00:22:19,464
- [Young-joo sighs]
<i>- Step lightly on the gas.</i>

418
00:22:20,048 --> 00:22:21,631
Fuck. Whoa!

419
00:22:21,632 --> 00:22:23,592
[yelling]

420
00:22:23,593 --> 00:22:26,804
[yelps] Holy fuck!
I almost just died.

421
00:22:28,222 --> 00:22:30,849
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

422
00:22:30,850 --> 00:22:33,477
[breathing heavily] Oh, shit. I can't.

423
00:22:33,478 --> 00:22:37,272
[yelps] It's going so fast.
It's too fast. [crying]

424
00:22:37,273 --> 00:22:39,441
Please do something. [yells]

425
00:22:39,442 --> 00:22:41,359
You guys gotta help me.

426
00:22:41,360 --> 00:22:44,488
- Don't turn like that.
<i>- Holy shit. How do I steer?</i>

427
00:22:44,489 --> 00:22:47,699
<i>How do I steer? I'm gonna crash. Ah, shit.</i>

428
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:49,659
<i>- I don't wanna die. Fuck!</i>
- Calm down.

429
00:22:49,660 --> 00:22:51,745
- Fuck! Fuck, fuck!
- Hey, hey. Hey!

430
00:22:51,746 --> 00:22:53,246
Jin-wook. Will you be quiet?

431
00:22:53,247 --> 00:22:56,501
Put your foot on the brake
and push it down lightly, got it?

432
00:22:57,335 --> 00:22:59,337
[zombies snarling]

433
00:23:02,548 --> 00:23:04,550
[panting]

434
00:23:05,551 --> 00:23:06,552
Shit.

435
00:23:13,351 --> 00:23:14,352
Shit.

436
00:23:15,186 --> 00:23:16,479
[both whimpering]

437
00:23:17,772 --> 00:23:20,273
Private Lee.
What do we do if there's a zombie?

438
00:23:20,274 --> 00:23:21,942
Just please shut your mouth.

439
00:23:21,943 --> 00:23:23,193
Yes, sir. I'm sorry.

440
00:23:23,194 --> 00:23:24,694
[exhales deeply]

441
00:23:24,695 --> 00:23:27,365
[breathing heavily, whimpers]

442
00:23:30,785 --> 00:23:31,786
[Jae-yoon] Shit.

443
00:23:33,287 --> 00:23:35,289
[both breathing heavily]

444
00:23:37,375 --> 00:23:38,209
Ra In-ho.

445
00:23:41,003 --> 00:23:44,507
Report to command...
that the hotel bathroom is all clear.

446
00:23:46,717 --> 00:23:48,386
There's a more urgent matter.

447
00:23:49,679 --> 00:23:51,264
- [urine trickling]
- [In-ho grunts]

448
00:23:54,225 --> 00:23:55,642
[grunting]

449
00:23:55,643 --> 00:23:57,270
- [snarls]
- [gunshot fires]

450
00:24:01,941 --> 00:24:03,775
- Sir, excuse me.
- [Tae-hwa] Huh?

451
00:24:03,776 --> 00:24:06,153
The food's stored in there.
The rest is over there.

452
00:24:06,154 --> 00:24:07,321
Okay.

453
00:24:16,164 --> 00:24:19,041
- We have no idea how long we'll be here.
- Right.

454
00:24:20,209 --> 00:24:22,460
- Take what's light, and high in calories.
- Hmm.

455
00:24:22,461 --> 00:24:24,796
And don't stop until your packs are full.

456
00:24:24,797 --> 00:24:26,632
- Yes, sir. Right away.
- Right away.

457
00:24:27,884 --> 00:24:29,968
- [Gye-young] Look at this.
- I'll take berries.

458
00:24:29,969 --> 00:24:31,762
[both grunting, gulping]

459
00:24:33,890 --> 00:24:35,892
- Jae-yoon, come back up.
- What?

460
00:24:36,559 --> 00:24:37,894
Look what I brought.

461
00:24:39,020 --> 00:24:40,021
You'll be all right.

462
00:24:40,771 --> 00:24:42,148
You actually got a good one.

463
00:24:43,357 --> 00:24:45,025
Look at you. Brilliant.

464
00:24:45,026 --> 00:24:46,611
[both sucking]

465
00:24:47,737 --> 00:24:49,988
Ah! [sighs]

466
00:24:49,989 --> 00:24:50,906
[Jae-yoon grunts]

467
00:24:50,907 --> 00:24:52,532
- [cell phone vibrates]
- [In-ho gasps]

468
00:24:52,533 --> 00:24:55,160
[water running, swishing]

469
00:24:55,161 --> 00:24:56,370
[Jae-yoon sighs] What?

470
00:24:57,997 --> 00:24:58,997
{\an8}[In-ho gasps]

471
00:24:58,998 --> 00:25:00,707
- Hey, Private Lee.
- Jesus, what?

472
00:25:00,708 --> 00:25:02,835
We just got Wi-Fi. Wi-Fi!

473
00:25:03,294 --> 00:25:04,128
Wi-Fi.

474
00:25:06,088 --> 00:25:08,883
Oh, my God. Wi-Fi.
Wi-Fi. Young-joo.

475
00:25:10,635 --> 00:25:12,010
YOUNG-JOO, MY LOVE

476
00:25:12,011 --> 00:25:12,970
[ringtone beeping]

477
00:25:15,514 --> 00:25:17,767
- [Young-joo] No, slow down.
- [Jin-wook] Go slow.

478
00:25:18,768 --> 00:25:20,310
[snarling]

479
00:25:20,311 --> 00:25:21,353
VIDEO CHAT... JAE-YOON

480
00:25:21,354 --> 00:25:23,605
- [Young-joo gasps]
- What?

481
00:25:23,606 --> 00:25:24,607
Whoa!

482
00:25:26,108 --> 00:25:27,359
Oh, Young-joo. Hey!

483
00:25:27,360 --> 00:25:28,777
Jae-yoon, hi!

484
00:25:28,778 --> 00:25:30,487
<i>Are you okay? Have you been hurt?</i>

485
00:25:30,488 --> 00:25:32,781
[crying] Everything's okay.

486
00:25:32,782 --> 00:25:35,909
[Young-joo] <i>What about you?
Are you hurt? Are you safe?</i>

487
00:25:35,910 --> 00:25:38,828
I'm okay. I'm not hurt.
Here, just look at me. See?

488
00:25:38,829 --> 00:25:41,414
- Oh, thank God.
<i>- Where are you at?</i>

489
00:25:41,415 --> 00:25:45,126
The A Tower garage, downstairs!
You're still here, right?

490
00:25:45,127 --> 00:25:47,170
- Huh?
<i>- What floor are you on?</i>

491
00:25:47,171 --> 00:25:48,797
<i>I'll come to you.</i>

492
00:25:48,798 --> 00:25:51,800
<i>I'm gonna come get you.
So just tell me which floor you're on.</i>

493
00:25:51,801 --> 00:25:54,386
No, Young-joo.
Why would you do that? You can't.

494
00:25:54,387 --> 00:25:56,179
<i>I had to. I was worried sick.</i>

495
00:25:56,180 --> 00:25:59,599
No, you can't come here, Young-joo.
Uh, what the hell?

496
00:25:59,600 --> 00:26:02,310
<i>Just please tell me what floor you're on.</i>

497
00:26:02,311 --> 00:26:05,021
Young-joo, listen.
This place is really really bad, okay?

498
00:26:05,022 --> 00:26:06,356
<i>You should go to a shelter.</i>

499
00:26:06,357 --> 00:26:08,441
No, I can't. I can't just leave you here.

500
00:26:08,442 --> 00:26:10,694
<i>- No, no. Listen.</i>
- Wait. I'll be right there.

501
00:26:10,695 --> 00:26:13,739
You shouldn't be anywhere
near this place. It's dangerous, okay?

502
00:26:14,532 --> 00:26:17,993
You don't know what I've been through
in the last few days, okay, Jae-yoon?

503
00:26:17,994 --> 00:26:20,412
<i>So, yes, I can.
I'm stronger than you think.</i>

504
00:26:20,413 --> 00:26:22,163
<i>I'll get you out of here.</i>

505
00:26:22,164 --> 00:26:25,667
<i>For the love of God,
just tell me which floor you're on.</i>

506
00:26:25,668 --> 00:26:27,128
[crying]

507
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:29,963
Oh, Jesus. Young-joo, are you there?

508
00:26:29,964 --> 00:26:32,216
<i>- Uh-huh.</i>
- So, I... I actually...

509
00:26:33,092 --> 00:26:36,219
