510
00:26:36,220 --> 00:26:37,305
So we're not there.

511
00:26:38,222 --> 00:26:40,433
- Huh?
<i>- So you should...</i>

512
00:26:41,309 --> 00:26:43,101
<i>- Go somewhere to hide--
-</i> [In-ho] <i>Suseo.</i>

513
00:26:43,102 --> 00:26:44,853
- Hey.
- There's a Central Command

514
00:26:44,854 --> 00:26:46,313
base camp in Suseo.

515
