Ugh! I wanna get out!

547
00:28:10,481 --> 00:28:12,607
Please let me get out! [crying]

548
00:28:12,608 --> 00:28:14,068
- [gunshot fires]
- [zombie snarls]

549
00:28:14,693 --> 00:28:15,694
[Young-man] Holy shit!

550
00:28:16,695 --> 00:28:17,696
Oh, shi--

551
