- [Paolo] Sir, wait! Please don't shoot.

585
00:29:44,533 --> 00:29:46,035
Are you all right?

586
00:29:47,119 --> 00:29:48,829
You haven't
been bitten, have you?

587
00:29:49,830 --> 00:29:51,123
