- [Soo-jeong] Yes.

588
00:29:52,291 --> 00:29:53,125
What?

589
00:29:54,460 --> 00:29:56,252
Were you... Were you bitten?

590
00:29:56,253 --> 00:29:57,378
- No, no.
- [Soo-jeong] No?

591
00:29:57,379 --> 00:30:00,256
- No. He's good.
- We still need to check him, all right?

592
00:30:00,257 --> 00:30:03,176
Oh, yeah. Hey, Paolo.
May we check for bites?

593
00:30:03,177 --> 00:30:04,261
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

594
00:30:05,930 --> 00:30:07,388
- Gye-young.
- RIght away.

595
00:30:07,389 --> 00:30:08,599
Paolo.

596
