I don't see any bites.

597
00:30:11,727 --> 00:30:13,478
You alone? Is there anyone else?

598
00:30:13,479 --> 00:30:15,396
There's not. There's no one else.

599
00:30:15,397 --> 00:30:19,317
The lobby upstairs sounded like a war.
So fucking dangerous.

600
00:30:19,318 --> 00:30:22,237
How the hell have you been
sleeping with what's going on?

601
00:30:22,238 --> 00:30:23,155
[Soo-jeong] Huh?

602
00:30:25,950 --> 00:30:26,866
Pills.

603
00:30:26,867 --> 00:30:28,743
