- I don't--

604
00:30:28,744 --> 00:30:30,954
Where did you get that?
You're a chef.

605
00:30:30,955 --> 00:30:32,413
You've been doing drugs here?

606
00:30:32,414 --> 00:30:34,290
No. Melatonin. A sleeping aid.

607
00:30:34,291 --> 00:30:36,752
- So not--
- Look, I'm scared.

608
00:30:37,127 --> 00:30:40,464
I wanna go. You think you guys
can take me to the embassy.

609
00:30:41,298 --> 00:30:42,800
