- [Tripeater yelps] Shit!

656
00:32:40,125 --> 00:32:43,252
Crazy asshole!
Please, I can't take it.

657
00:32:43,253 --> 00:32:44,629
[brakes screech]

658
00:32:44,630 --> 00:32:45,922
[all panting]

659
00:32:45,923 --> 00:32:48,132
Isn't it better to be crazier than them?

660
00:32:48,133 --> 00:32:50,885
[Tripeater] Whatever happens,
it's better to be alive.

661
00:32:50,886 --> 00:32:52,846
Stop acting like a maniac.

662
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:57,893
You think 'cause you found the car,
you're less of a dumbass? Huh?

663
00:32:58,435 --> 00:33:02,022
I guess you forgot that I took you in
when you were dying on the street.

664
00:33:03,357 --> 00:33:05,484
You should remember your place, Tripeater.

665
00:33:06,652 --> 00:33:09,905
Do your parents know
you're walking the streets hammered? Huh?

666
00:33:10,322 --> 00:33:13,491
This is why you repeated
your exams three times.

667
00:33:13,492 --> 00:33:15,410
I feel sorry for your parents.

668
00:33:15,411 --> 00:33:18,621
They're probably disappointed
that you ended up like this.

669
00:33:18,622 --> 00:33:21,082
What are you doing?
You're crazy. Get off of me.

670
00:33:21,083 --> 00:33:24,794
Sounds like you wanna die today.
I'll bite your head off right here.

671
00:33:24,795 --> 00:33:27,631
[Young-joo sighs] Just calm down.
Just take it easy.

672
00:33:28,507 --> 00:33:31,301
You see these eyes?
I wouldn't push your luck.

673
00:33:32,886 --> 00:33:34,804
Uh. All right, all right. I...

674
00:33:34,805 --> 00:33:37,057
Okay, I get it.
You're right, you're right.

675
00:33:37,558 --> 00:33:38,434
Just let go.

676
00:33:38,892 --> 00:33:39,727
[Tripeater sighs]

677
00:33:40,644 --> 00:33:42,146
