678
00:33:43,063 --> 00:33:46,441
While I appreciate you letting me
tag along with you guys,

679
00:33:46,442 --> 00:33:48,526
just watch who you're talking to.

680
00:33:48,527 --> 00:33:50,362
- [Jin-wook] Mmm-hmm.
- You dick.

681
00:33:51,613 --> 00:33:54,282
All your money's worthless,
when you're an asshole.

682
00:33:54,283 --> 00:33:56,284
Hey, Boozer, don't you agree?

683
00:33:56,285 --> 00:33:57,619
[chuckles]

684
00:33:58,662 --> 00:34:00,705
- Son of a bitch.
- [Tripeater] What? Drive.

685
00:34:00,706 --> 00:34:02,207
[Jin-wook] Mmm-hmm.

686
00:34:15,929 --> 00:34:18,474
- [Paolo] Enjoy.
- [Jae-yoon pants] Thank you so much.

687
00:34:20,934 --> 00:34:23,853
We don't know when
our next meal will be. So eat up.

688
00:34:23,854 --> 00:34:25,022
[all] Yes, sir.

689
00:34:27,149 --> 00:34:29,233
- Split this bread with me.
- [In-ho sighs]

690
00:34:29,234 --> 00:34:30,568
JUNG TAE-HWA 05/04/25

691
