699
00:34:52,966 --> 00:34:55,551
No smoking.
This is a Michelin star restaurant.

700
00:34:55,552 --> 00:34:58,013
What the hell?
What are you guys doing here?

701
00:34:58,764 --> 00:35:01,057
- Man. What's your problem?
