705
00:35:08,690 --> 00:35:13,027
Oh, fucking hell.
And you can't vape in here either.

706
00:35:13,028 --> 00:35:14,237
Ugh. Fuck!

707
00:35:14,238 --> 00:35:16,447
- Wait. Where are you going?
- [Paolo] It's ruined.

708
00:35:16,448 --> 00:35:17,990
I'm gonna go grab a soda.

709
00:35:17,991 --> 00:35:21,202
- Sir, I can get it for you.
- It's fine. I can get my own soda.

710
00:35:21,203 --> 00:35:23,871
