715
00:35:56,697 --> 00:35:59,156
[Tae-hwa breathing shakily]

716
00:35:59,157 --> 00:36:01,201
[faint snarling]

717
00:36:02,995 --> 00:36:03,870
[snarling]

718
00:36:03,871 --> 00:36:05,329
- [Tae-hwa yells]
- [gunshot fires]

719
00:36:05,330 --> 00:36:06,832
[all exclaim in surprise]

720
00:36:09,418 --> 00:36:10,918
- [Young-man] Huh?
- What was that?

721
00:36:10,919 --> 00:36:12,670
- A gunshot.
- [In-ho] Get ready.

722
00:36:12,671 --> 00:36:14,255
[Jae-yoon] Go round the table.

723
00:36:14,256 --> 00:36:16,507
Sergeant Kim! Wait. Hold on.
Just wait a minute.

724
00:36:16,508 --> 00:36:17,968
- Lee Jae-yoon
- Please wait.

725
00:36:22,222 --> 00:36:23,640
It's Sergeant Young-man!

726
00:36:24,349 --> 00:36:25,559
Are you alright, sir?

727
00:36:27,227 --> 00:36:28,644
Shit...

728
00:36:28,645 --> 00:36:30,021
[zombie snarling in distance]

729
00:36:30,022 --> 00:36:32,356
I'm gonna come in there.
I just need you to--

730
00:36:32,357 --> 00:36:34,109
[all whimpering]

731
00:36:35,402 --> 00:36:37,904
- [all yelping]
- Jesus Christ.

732
00:36:37,905 --> 00:36:38,906
[snarls]

733
00:36:40,198 --> 00:36:41,033
[all] Huh?

734
00:36:42,367 --> 00:36:43,785
[all exclaiming]

735
00:36:45,287 --> 00:36:46,747
[hissing]

736
00:36:48,040 --> 00:36:49,081
[Jae-yoon] Holy fuck.

737
00:36:49,082 --> 00:36:50,708
[all yelping]

738
00:36:50,709 --> 00:36:53,252
- [Soo-jeong whimpers]
- [Gye-young] Get it, get it.

739
00:36:53,253 --> 00:36:54,880
[all whimpering]

740
00:36:55,631 --> 00:36:57,090
[zombie grunts]

741
00:36:58,342 --> 00:37:00,302
[breathing shakily]

742
00:37:05,474 --> 00:37:07,684
[Jae-yoon whimpers]

743
00:37:10,187 --> 00:37:11,354
[all sighing in relief]

744
00:37:11,355 --> 00:37:13,774
[Jae-yoon] Oh, shit.

745
00:37:17,069 --> 00:37:19,196
[faint snarling]

746
00:37:23,825 --> 00:37:25,953
[all gasping]

747
00:37:27,621 --> 00:37:29,623
- First Sergeant.
- [Jae-yoon] What?

748
00:37:33,418 --> 00:37:35,420
[all breathing shakily]

749
00:37:41,218 --> 00:37:42,301
Jesus.

750
00:37:42,302 --> 00:37:44,388
[snarling continues]

751
00:37:46,640 --> 00:37:49,476
His nose. The closer
to the brain the wound is,

752
00:37:50,727 --> 00:37:52,228
the faster it spreads.

753
00:37:52,229 --> 00:37:53,145
[hissing]

754
00:37:53,146 --> 00:37:54,690
[all whimpering]

755
00:37:57,651 --> 00:37:59,861
[tense music playing]

756
00:38:05,659 --> 00:38:07,661
[Young-man breathing shakily]

757
00:38:09,579 --> 00:38:10,747
[sobbing]

758
00:38:23,260 --> 00:38:25,137
[Jae-yoon] Shoot, shoot, shoot!

759
00:38:25,679 --> 00:38:26,930
[tense music fades out]

760
00:38:27,848 --> 00:38:30,057
I have to get to
Seoul Hospital before Suseo.

761
00:38:30,058 --> 00:38:32,561
- So first we'll stop there.
- A hospital?

762
00:38:33,520 --> 00:38:34,438
My mom's in there.

763
00:38:35,272 --> 00:38:38,817
Ah! I'm sorry. Is she sick?

764
00:38:39,276 --> 00:38:40,444
I never told you, did I?

765
00:38:41,236 --> 00:38:42,362
The hospital is hers.

766
00:38:43,071 --> 00:38:44,740
She bought the place a while ago.

767
00:38:45,991 --> 00:38:48,993
I need to get to Suseo, okay?
That's where Jae-yoon said--

768
00:38:48,994 --> 00:38:51,787
Are we supposed to just
let this kid wither away?

769
00:38:51,788 --> 00:38:52,913
[Young-joo] Huh?

770
00:38:52,914 --> 00:38:56,042
We'll get him treatment
as soon as we get to the hospital.

771
00:38:56,043 --> 00:38:57,877
And you should also get looked at.

772
00:38:57,878 --> 00:39:00,005
Suseo station's right down the street.

773
00:39:00,922 --> 00:39:02,256
Once we're done, we'll go.

774
00:39:02,257 --> 00:39:05,052
- But you need to get treated there, okay?
- Okay.

775
00:39:06,344 --> 00:39:07,345
[clears throat]

776
00:39:09,598 --> 00:39:10,431
[retches]

777
00:39:10,432 --> 00:39:12,184
Hey! Do that out the window, dude.

778
00:39:12,893 --> 00:39:14,310
Stop the car. I need to go.

779
00:39:14,311 --> 00:39:16,187
Are you stupid? We can't stop here.

780
00:39:16,188 --> 00:39:18,064
If you don't stop, maybe I'll--

781
00:39:18,065 --> 00:39:20,232
Ah! No, no, no, no. All right, all right.

782
00:39:20,233 --> 00:39:22,152
- [brakes screech]
- [Jin-wook] Jesus Christ.

783
00:39:22,652 --> 00:39:24,904
Shit. This kid is insane.

784
00:39:24,905 --> 00:39:25,906
[Young-joo] Hey!

785
00:39:26,907 --> 00:39:29,116
[Tripeater grunting]

786
00:39:29,117 --> 00:39:30,494
[retches]

787
00:39:31,369 --> 00:39:35,582
Oh! Is there a bathroom here
you could use?

788
00:39:37,084 --> 00:39:37,917
I had to puke.

789
00:39:37,918 --> 00:39:40,419
You could just do that
like wherever you want.

790
00:39:40,420 --> 00:39:42,839
Ew. So gross. That's just you, man.

791
00:39:43,423 --> 00:39:44,257
[Tripeater chuckles]

792
00:39:44,883 --> 00:39:48,344
[sighs] Black pepper ramen
would change the game right now.

793
00:39:48,345 --> 00:39:51,722
Hey, if you don't know yet,
it's amazing at carrying a hangover.

794
00:39:51,723 --> 00:39:53,432
I know it's crazy.

795
00:39:53,433 --> 00:39:55,643
- Oh, I see you there.
- Ha!

796
00:39:55,644 --> 00:39:57,770
Yeah, those drinks are really strong.

797
00:39:57,771 --> 00:39:59,147
I'm sober now, at least.

798
00:39:59,856 --> 00:40:02,108
Yeah, it's kind of wearing off
for me, too.

799
00:40:02,109 --> 00:40:04,402
- I think that I'll head back now.
- Huh?

800
00:40:07,280 --> 00:40:11,200
[sighs] No, let's stay together
and get you to the hospital.

801
00:40:11,201 --> 00:40:13,494
- Then we'll go to Suseo.
- No, don't worry.

802
00:40:13,495 --> 00:40:17,124
I'm scared of hospitals. I'll stay.
I go back home and study.

803
00:40:17,541 --> 00:40:19,375
What, for school? What a dumbass.

804
00:40:19,376 --> 00:40:22,670
I just think the zombie
the situation could end any day.

805
00:40:22,671 --> 00:40:25,965
It's a good idea to be ready.
I can take care of myself now.

806
00:40:25,966 --> 00:40:28,176
- [zombies snarling]
- [Young-joo gasps]

807
00:40:32,639 --> 00:40:34,348
Leave me here.
Get out while you can.

808
00:40:34,349 --> 00:40:36,559
- I can handle this.
- Yeah. See ya.

809
00:40:36,560 --> 00:40:38,060
We're going to the hospital.

810
00:40:38,061 --> 00:40:41,147
Hey, you know you don't
have to do this, right.

811
00:40:41,148 --> 00:40:44,568
Ah, like I always say, "No worry."

812
00:40:45,277 --> 00:40:46,111
No worry?

813
00:40:46,528 --> 00:40:48,445
[Jin-wook] No worry. He wants to stay.

814
00:40:48,446 --> 00:40:50,573
Why don't you hit
the books, like you said?

815
00:40:50,574 --> 00:40:51,699
That'd be better.

816
00:40:51,700 --> 00:40:53,159
[Tripeater grunts]

817
00:40:53,160 --> 00:40:54,369
Okay.

818
00:40:55,162 --> 00:40:56,453
[grunting]

819
00:40:56,454 --> 00:40:58,664
Hey, just go. Drive away, you moron.

820
00:40:58,665 --> 00:41:01,710
- Hey, wanna repeat that?
- Just step on it right now...

821
00:41:02,419 --> 00:41:03,295
moron.

822
00:41:05,255 --> 00:41:06,339
Hold on. What?

823
00:41:07,257 --> 00:41:08,257
Wait. Jin-wook.

824
00:41:08,258 --> 00:41:09,342
Hey.

825
00:41:09,926 --> 00:41:11,178
Be careful.

826
00:41:11,970 --> 00:41:14,346
- Are you gonna be okay?
- [engine whirring]

827
00:41:14,347 --> 00:41:15,723
[zombies snarling]

828
00:41:15,724 --> 00:41:18,058
Wait. Oh, shit. Wait. [grunts]

829
00:41:18,059 --> 00:41:21,020
Don't go. [grunting]

830
00:41:21,021 --> 00:41:23,106
[snarling continues]

831
00:41:24,191 --> 00:41:25,650
[yelling]

832
00:41:26,651 --> 00:41:27,944
[grunting]

833
00:41:34,659 --> 00:41:36,327
Do you think that he's all right?

834
00:41:36,328 --> 00:41:38,163
[sentimental music playing]

835
00:41:41,583 --> 00:41:42,542
[Young-joo exhales]

836
00:41:44,586 --> 00:41:46,922
Hold on. Did we ever get his real name?

837
00:41:48,215 --> 00:41:49,090
[sighs]

838
00:41:50,258 --> 00:41:52,552
I should've asked
what his name was.

839
00:41:55,222 --> 00:41:56,806
He was transforming already.

840
00:41:57,974 --> 00:42:00,143
If he came with us, we'd be dead tomorrow.

841
00:42:02,938 --> 00:42:04,481
Now we go our own ways.

842
00:42:05,899 --> 00:42:07,983
[sentimental music continues]

843
00:42:07,984 --> 00:42:09,069
No worry.

844
00:42:12,072 --> 00:42:13,073
Dumbass.

845
00:42:20,705 --> 00:42:22,499
Now we go our own ways.

846
00:42:22,958 --> 00:42:24,000
No worry.

847
00:42:24,960 --> 00:42:27,754
[grunts] Shit, man. Come here. Go on.

848
00:42:28,255 --> 00:42:29,923
Die! Die!

849
00:42:30,715 --> 00:42:32,259
[grunts] Die!

850
00:42:33,009 --> 00:42:34,052
Fuck you!

851
00:42:34,886 --> 00:42:36,263
Die. [grunting]

852
00:42:37,555 --> 00:42:40,392
How's that feel?
That's easier than studying for me.

853
00:42:41,893 --> 00:42:43,103
[grunting]

854
00:42:43,895 --> 00:42:45,897
[groaning]

855
00:42:55,115 --> 00:42:56,824
[music stops]

856
00:42:56,825 --> 00:42:58,910
[tense music plays]

857
00:42:59,911 --> 00:43:00,870
[snarls]

858
00:43:01,454 --> 00:43:03,456
[male choir vocalizing]

859
00:43:08,128 --> 00:43:10,130
[man singing Korean song]

860
00:43:37,574 --> 00:43:39,576
[man continues singing Korean song]

861
00:44:07,062 --> 00:44:09,064
[man continues singing Korean song]

862
00:45:28,810 --> 00:45:30,812
[man continues singing Korean song]

863
00:45:54,752 --> 00:45:56,754
[man continues singing Korean song]

864
00:46:59,150 --> 00:47:02,111
[song fades out]

865
00:47:03,404 --> 00:47:05,406
[tense music playing]

866
00:47:24,175 --> 00:47:26,177
[tense music continues]

867
00:47:59,335 --> 00:48:01,337
[music fades out]

